<title>USA: Amer Intl unit issues $100 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Amer Intl unit issues $100 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from International Lease Finance Co, a unit of American International Group Inc was priced Monday via lead manager Morgan Stanley, Dean Witter, &amp; Discover &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER INTERNATIONAL LEASE FINANCE CO</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 6.375 PCT  MATURITY 8/1/2001</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.714  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1    YIELD 6.454 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS    SPREAD 34.5 BPS   CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
